# Build context for docker/stand/Dockerfile (Dockerfile-scoped ignore file).
# Keep secrets (any .env at any depth, the rendered relay config), image archives (`docker save | gzip` output),
# VCS data, local graph outputs, the untracked reference checkouts, and the stand's own tests with their fixtures
# out of the image entirely.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/.envrc
!**/.env.example
docker/relay/iroh-relay.toml
**/*.tar.gz
docker/stand/tools/*.test.mjs
docker/stand/tools/fixtures
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude
.beads
.beads*
.dsh-build
.artifacts
.playwright-mcp
coverage
graphify-out
graphify-out.bak-*
references
*.tsbuildinfo
website/.dist
website/.generated
node_modules
**/node_modules
